Q.cpk_stage = 5;
const railLead = (Number(Q.cpk_rail_priority) || 0) >= 25;
const publicHeld = (Number(Q.cpk_public_ownership) || 0) >= 15;
const conflicted = (Number(Q.cpk_land_conflict) || 0) >= 20;
Q.cpk_settlement = Q.cpk_cancelled
    ? "Hub cancelled; the railway and the land question outlive it"
    : (railLead
        ? "A railway programme with an airport attached to it"
        : (publicHeld
            ? "A publicly owned hub and rail programme under construction"
            : "A hub programme delivered on somebody else's balance sheet"));
Q.cpk_public_verdict = conflicted
    ? "The land grievance is still the loudest thing about it"
    : "The site has stopped producing weekly grievance stories";
Q.news_headline = "The Central Communications Port becomes an election argument";
!}

= [+ date_label +] — Scenario horizon: what got built

The campaign has started and the programme has a physical form at last.
**[+ cpk_settlement +].** [+ cpk_public_verdict +].

[? if cpk_delivery >= 15: The tunnel under Łódź is finished and open to
inspection, which means the state can be photographed beside something it
completed rather than something it announced.?][? if cpk_delivery < 15: There is
still very little a photographer can use: earthworks, a lined tunnel bore, and
site offices. Delivery is a promise about the 2030s.?]
[? if cpk_labour_standard >= 25: Twelve thousand people work on the site under a
sectoral agreement, which is now the largest single collective bargaining unit
in Poland.?]
[? if cpk_cost_pressure >= 25: The overrun is public, large, and being read out
at every opposition press conference.?]
[? if cpk_left_credit >= 15: Whatever the programme becomes, our fingerprints
are on the parts of it people like.?][? if cpk_left_credit < 5: Nobody
associates any part of this with us, which after three years of arguing about it
is its own kind of result.?]

Everything about the project that we can still decide is now a campaign
decision.

- @cpk_final_campaign
- @cpk_final_audit
- @cpk_final_public_works
- @cpk_final_quiet

@cpk_final_campaign
title: Run on the timetable
subtitle: Put the station names and the dates on every poster in the affected voivodeships.
on-arrival: {!
Q.cpk_left_credit += 5;
Q.rural_support += 3;
Q.workers_support += 2;
