!}

The poster is a timetable. Town, line, year. No slogan, no leader's face, no
adjective. In the communes on the map it is the most effective piece of material
our press office has produced in a decade, because it makes a promise that can be
checked.

[? if cpk_land_conflict >= 20: In the communes beside the site it lands
differently. There, the same poster is read as a bill presented to people who
already paid.?]

- @poland_event_queue: Print the timetable

@cpk_final_audit
title: Publish the full cost record before anybody else does
subtitle: Overruns, contracts, valuations and delays, released by us, on our timing.
on-arrival: {!
Q.cpk_left_credit += 3;
Q.public_trust += 4;
Q.institutional_issue_salience += 2;
Q.cpk_cost_pressure = Math.max(0, (Number(Q.cpk_cost_pressure) || 0) - 8);
