Q.last_policy_implementation = "Complete cost and contract record published";
Q.news_headline = "The whole CPK cost record is published before the campaign can leak it";
!}

Every overrun, every renegotiated contract, every valuation dispute, in one
document with an index. It is not flattering and it is not supposed to be.

Releasing it ourselves costs a week of bad headlines and removes an entire
category of attack for the rest of the campaign, because there is nothing left
to reveal. [? if left_in_government = 1: Our coalition partners, who were not
consulted about the timing, discover the document at the same time as the
press.?]

- @poland_event_queue: Publish the record

@cpk_final_public_works
title: Turn the workforce into a permanent public construction capacity
subtitle: Cost: 2 resources. Promise that the crews, the machines and the agreement outlive the project.
choose-if: resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: The programme cannot be costed and defended in a campaign month.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 2;
Q.cpk_public_works = 1;
Q.cpk_left_credit += 6;
Q.cpk_public_ownership += 10;
Q.workers_support += 4;
Q.labor_credibility += 4;
Q.household_policy_pressure += 3;
Q.social_spending_support += 2;
Q.razem_dissent -= 3;
Q.last_policy_stage = Q.left_in_government ? "Implementation" : "Proposal";
Q.last_policy_authority = Q.left_in_government
    ? "Council of Ministers and the state investment company"
    : "Election programme of the Left";
Q.last_policy_implementation = Q.left_in_government
    ? "Public construction capacity retained beyond the programme"
    : "Not enacted";
Q.news_headline = "The Left promises the site's workforce a life after the site";
!}

The argument is that the most valuable thing the programme built is not a
runway or a tunnel but twelve thousand trained people, a machine park and a
procurement department that knows how to run a project of this size. Privatising
that at the end would be the most Polish decision imaginable.

So the proposal is a permanent public construction capacity: housing, flood
defences, hospital rebuilds, the next railway. The employers' confederation
objects on principle. The construction unions, who have spent three years
negotiating on this site, understand exactly what is being offered and say so
loudly enough for the evening news.

- @poland_event_queue: Announce the capacity

@cpk_final_quiet
title: Keep it out of the campaign
subtitle: Say nothing about the project, defend nothing, and let the other parties fight over it.
on-arrival: {!
Q.cpk_left_credit -= 4;
Q.economic_issue_salience -= 1;
Q.party_unity -= 2;
Q.razem_dissent += 2;
